# build_app at the console (typed), as the agent case's board: the disk's
# data volume holds agentd's home, virtio-net and inet the network. On
# the host, e2e.sh runs tools/api-proxy/e2e_serve.py (serve): the
# stand-in for the Messages API, answering from script.json and checking
# each request as checks.json says, and the proxy in front of it, which
# builds apps (builder) by fake_claude.py, whose program is a copy of
# hello, and which paints preview.png as the scene main. run agent asks
# for an app; the script answers with build_app, whose preview shows at
# the console as an image and whose progress as the stand-in session's
# lines, then with list_dir apps, hello there whole, run apps/hello, the
# program the build put in the home and marked one, and show_image of
# the preview and of the program, refused; then a text. Then the shell
# lists the home's apps and the app's previews.
start /bin/sh
start /sbin/uart noecho
start /sbin/virtio-blk
start /sbin/fs
start /sbin/virtio-net
start /sbin/inet
start /sbin/agentd
dev /sbin/uart
dev /sbin/virtio-blk
dev /sbin/virtio-net
